      "problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 6 & -4 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form.",
